<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Shiva Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Shiva Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it cut its rating on Shiva Corp to market outperform and removed the stock from its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Late Tuesday Shiva said it expected fourth quarter earnings of $0.05 to $0.07 a share, far below the First Call analysts' consensus view of $0.21.</p>
<p>-- Shiva cited weakness in U.S. sales and a key partner's decision to delay an order.</p>
<p>-- Shiva dropped 15-3/4 to 19 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
